The '''Slayer''' is an [[Ascendancy class]] for [[Duelist]]s.

==Overview==
[[Image:Ascendancy skill tree Slayer.PNG|290px|thumb|right|Slayer skill tree]]

The Slayer is an offence-oriented class based around [[attacks]]. Most of his notables provide straightforward damage increases through [[critical strike]]s, [[attack speed]], [[accuracy]], or simply more damage. With an enhanced [[culling strike]] and a damage bonus against [[unique monsters]], the Slayer is an excellent boss-killer. Defensively, the Slayer has several conditional buffs while leeching as well as access to [[Leech#Leech duration|overleech]], making those buffs easy to maintain as long as the character keeps attacking. Additionally, the Slayer can replace the default [[endurance charge]] limit with his [[frenzy charge]] limit, allowing simultaneous investment in both offence and defence.

